---
import data from '../../../data/templates/source.json';
const info = data.info;
---

<footer style="background-color: #2E3826; color: #F1ECE0;">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-5 md:px-10 py-14 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-6">
        <p class="font-cormorant italic text-5xl">{info.wordmark}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-manrope text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em]" style="color: #B5613F;">{info.soustitre}</p>
        <p class="mt-6 font-manrope text-[14px] leading-relaxed max-w-md" style="color: rgba(241,236,224,0.82);">
          La naturopathie n'est ni une médecine, ni un substitut. C'est un accompagnement en hygiène de vie, complémentaire au suivi médical.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="font-manrope text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] mb-3" style="color: #B5613F;">Cabinet</p>
        <p class="font-manrope text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed" style="color: rgba(241,236,224,0.82);">
          {info.adresseLigne1}<br/>{info.adresseLigne2}<br/>{info.ouvertureHebdo}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="font-manrope text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] mb-3" style="color: #B5613F;">Contact</p>
        <ul class="font-manrope text-[13.5px] space-y-2" style="color: rgba(241,236,224,0.82);">
          <li><a href={`tel:${info.telephoneHref}`} class="hover:text-[#B5613F]">{info.telephone}</a></li>
          <li><a href={`mailto:${info.email}`} class="hover:text-[#B5613F]">{info.email}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-14 pt-6 border-t flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 justify-between font-manrope text-[11px]" style="border-color: rgba(241,236,224,0.15); color: rgba(241,236,224,0.55);">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {info.nom} — Démo 9site4 (fictif).</p>
      <p>Praticienne formée · n'établit ni diagnostic ni prescription.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
